  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "'## [12.0.0](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/compare/v11.5.0...v12.0.0) (2026-07-07)\n\n### ⚠ BREAKING CHANGES\n\n* **leader-election:** make queue and reconciliation leader-loss-aware (#1130)\n\n### Features\n\n* **hosting:** add better k3s support ([#1173](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1173)) ([19d3265](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/19d3265d44cf16c52646a3f43cba5459175d674c)), closes [#1170](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1170)\n* **leader-election:** make queue and reconciliation leader-loss-aware ([#1130](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1130)) ([3fd1e20](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/3fd1e20a928a970ab7c07560bdb847b0dab14cb4)), closes [#784](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/784)\n\n### Dependencies\n\n* **ci:** update actions/setup-node action to v6 ([#1178](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1178)) ([939ef9d](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/939ef9d45789489af2d0d114afa36ffae2cd3d25))\n* **ci:** update dependency node to v24 ([#1180](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1180)) ([109190a](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/109190ae2989a67a7a81ca1d7e9dc114322ec6e1))\n* **ci:** update semantic-release digest to 7432183 ([#1176](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1176)) ([8786fc3](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/8786fc327add12ff91a65db0c1e53e34806004d2))\n* **core:** update dependency sonaranalyzer.csharp to 10.28.0.143324 ([#1171](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1171)) ([984dc8a](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/984dc8aa7d8e2eff43611a0d54f60a8a440ce48d))\n* **core:** update spectre-console monorepo to 0.57.2 ([#1177](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1177)) ([57dcf59](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/57dcf59e417d42aced57f1920b99db4a7839c88b))\n* **test:** update dotnet monorepo to 5.6.0 ([#1172](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1172)) ([4ed3a89](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/4ed3a89dc394eae2c07d829850cea903b1cf348a))\n* **tools:** update dependency nuget-license to v4.0.14 ([#1169](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1169)) ([6c0ab72](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/6c0ab727331e51b0dbc56c74064453e0d5d24fef))\n\n### Documentation\n\n* **operator:** documentation rework ([#1184](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1184)) ([e240d4b](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/e240d4be9208eb1f179a99ca73fb4f49df59d758))\n* **operator:** refine advanced configuration and deployment docs, restructure GitHub Pages workflow ([#1182](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1182)) ([29b5b52](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/29b5b52b355d0756b9777788f3e2d31b16c8b245))\n'",
